rently she's good to  leave the hospital in the past 102 days  before the accident tess's teacher tells  her that she has a lot of potential to  be a photographer that maybe she should  take more romantic pictures  which makes tessa wonder what she loves  tessa starts to think more and more  about skyler and one day while taking  pictures for some athletes she sees him  again  tessa decides to go over and give him  his cat back and the two start talking  very happily since they didn't believe  they would find each other again  at that moment skyler's mother appears  and she tells tessa that her son has not  stopped talking about her that he was  even looking for her days after seeing  her at the movies  later tessa and skye decide to go for a  walk together and then they go to an  abandoned museum that used to be for  newlyweds  they walk around the place and tessa  takes some photos then they both decide  to sit down and talk and end up kissing  skye takes tessa home and they agree to  meet again at the end of the month to  spend the whole summer together  in the future  tessa is very sad over the loss of skye  she talks with a friend and explains the  strange events that make her think that  skye is close although the friend  doesn't believe her  later tessa goes to school and there the  teacher tells her that soon she has to  submit a portfolio with her best photos  to get into a good university but tessa  doesn't seem interested in that anymore  tessa decides to go for a walk and  starts to remember all the photos she  took of skye  so she ends up very sad and decides to  throw her camera into a lake  later she returns home and decides to  throw away all the material she used to  develop her photos  and tells her father that she's giving  up photography  that night tessa goes to sleep and  dreams that skye hugs her and tells her  that he's still there when she wakes up  she's very surprised and begins to  believe that skye is giving her signs  from beyond the grave  at that moment tessa hears sounds in the  room where she developed the photos she  decides to enter and realizes the  machine is printing a photograph  tessa decides to take all her materials  out of the trash and with these she  begins to color the photograph realizing  that it is a photo she took when she  went to the museum with skye tessa is  quite amazed and decides to put another  sheet in to see if the machine prints  another image then  as there is no response she decides to  approach and inadvertently places her  hand on the sheet  the machine prints an image and when  tessa goes to color it she realizes that  her hand was printed but that skye's  hand also appears intertwined with hers  although the image fades after a few  seconds  tessa convinced that skye is sending her  signals decides to go see the woman in  the hospital but realizes that she has  already left although at that moment the  doctor tells her that the woman left a  book for her tessa starts reading the  book and learns a lot about the  afterlife and also finds out that some  cameras can capture ghosts  in the past tessa and skye have a date  but skye is sad because his parents are  going to divorce tessa tells him that  sometimes that happens in relationships  but skye replies that he doesn't believe  that since he believes the couple should  fight for their love  another day  tessa and skye go for a walk and tessa  tells him that her father abandoned her  when she was a baby and that later when  she was a girl her mother also abandoned  her  she was at an orphanage until her  current parents adopted her as a  teenager the next day tessa and skye go  to a lake to take some photos and then  they row a boat skye tells her that he  loves her but tessa doesn't respond  the two decide to go back to the car  uncomfortable but just at that moment  tessa decides to kiss him passionately  and they end up making love in the  future  tessa talks to her friend about the  photographs that appeare