ys after the fight tessa and skye meet  again at a party and there tessa looks  for the right moment to tell him that  she loves him however she ends up  realizing that skye is going to another  university that's on the other side of  the country tessa gets angry with sky  because she thinks he wants to abandon  her sky responds that he's going to that  university to be closer to his father  since he's not feeling well to which  tessa could only reply that she needs  him too skye tells her that she can't  understand him since she doesn't have a  family which makes tessa angrier and she  breaks up with him  in the future tessa goes to all the  places where she spent time with skye  and takes photos of herself with a  special camera to see if skye's ghost  appears in one of them  tessa finishes her trip in the museum  and sitting in the place where she had  the first kiss with skye  she sees a light in a mirror on the  ceiling  suddenly tessa begins to walk up the  wall inching closer to the mirror upon  reaching the mirror she sees sky on the  other side both of them try to break the  barrier but they only end up breaking  the mirror the connection ends and tess  ends up falling to the ground  then tessa's parents find out that she  went to the abandoned museum so they  scold her  and just at that moment  tessa faints  they take her to the hospital and the  doctor tells them that her heart wound  is reopened they will have to operate on  her the next day  tessa hearing this tells them  desperately that she has to go because  she knows that she only has a few hours  left to meet skye again however the  doctor does not listen to her and only  sedates her  later tessa wakes up and decides to call  her friend and tells her that she has to  meet up with sky as soon as possible the  friend decides to go to the hospital and  take her out without permission  both girls get into the car and suddenly  it starts driving on its own until it  takes them right to the place where t